
### 1. Get all documents
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/documents
Accept: application/json
### 2. Add a document
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "document_name": "Citizenship",
    "document_type": "Identity",
    "document_number": "123456789",
    "issue_date": "2020-01-01",
    "expiry_date": "2030-01-01",
    "reminder_days": 30
}
### 3. Get one document
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/documents/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update a document
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/documents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "document_name": "National ID",
    "document_type": "Identity",
    "document_number": "123456789",
    "issue_date": "2020-01-01",
    "expiry_date": "2030-01-01",
    "reminder_days": 30
}

### 5. Delete a document
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/documents/1
Accept: application/json